---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { REPO_URL, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<Base
	title="About — Sidewinder Labs"
	description="Sidewinder Labs builds open-source data tools. Its first project is Sidewinder Flow Studio."
>
	<section class="section">
		<div class="wrap about">
			<div class="prose">
				<span class="eyebrow">About</span>
				<h1>Sidewinder Labs</h1>

				<h2>Why Sidewinder?</h2>
				<p>
					A sidewinder is a desert rattlesnake that moves sideways across loose sand — fast, efficient,
					leaving its distinctive tracks. It's also the name of a guided missile known for speed and
					agility. And a snake is a fitting mascot for a tool built on Python.
				</p>

				<h2>Why this exists</h2>
				<p>
					Data work tends to be split across tools that don't talk to each other: a spreadsheet for
					cleaning, a script for loading, a notebook for analysis, something else for charts. Each handover
					loses context, and nobody can reconstruct how a number was produced.
				</p>
				<p>
					Flow Studio puts the whole path on one canvas — preparing, transforming, loading, exploring — with
					every step as readable code and every intermediate result open to inspection.
				</p>

				<h2>Who's behind it</h2>
				<p>
					Sidewinder Labs is Evan Kouravelos, based in Athens — a data and BI practitioner with a background
					in enterprise analytics platforms. Flow Studio started as a tool for real pipelines and is now
					developed in the open.
				</p>

				<p class="links">
					<a class="btn btn--ghost" href={REPO_URL}>GitHub</a>
					{CONTACT_EMAIL && <a class="btn btn--ghost" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>Contact</a>}
				</p>
			</div>
			<img class="mark" src="/sidewinder-labs-logo.svg" alt="The Sidewinder Labs logo: a rattlesnake coiled around a rocket." width="280" height="280" />
		</div>
	</section>
</Base>

<style>
	.about {
		display: grid;
		gap: 40px;
		align-items: start;
	}
	@media (min-width: 900px) {
		.about {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
			gap: 64px;
		}
		.mark {
			position: sticky;
			top: 96px;
		}
	}
	.about h2 {
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		margin-top: 1.8em;
	}
	.mark {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 280px;
		border-radius: 28px;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	}
	.links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 2em;
	}
	@media (max-width: 899px) {
		.mark {
			max-width: 160px;
			grid-row: 1;
		}
	}
</style>
